# ============================================================================
# §Doc-only — version → SAID surface rename (#174-era)
# ============================================================================
# The verifier surface across KEL/IEL/SEL is moving from version-based
# (u64) to SAID-based (Digest256) for `divergence_ancestor` (was
# `diverged_at_version` / `diverged_at_serial`) and the seal field
# (`last_governance_event` / `last_recovery_revealing_event`, was
# `last_governance_version` / `last_recovery_revealing_serial`). The
# code still uses the old names; docs are renamed first to express the
# intent. These patterns block doc regression without forbidding the
# old names in code.

\bdiverged_at_version\b
\bdiverged_at_serial\b
\blast_governance_version\b
\blast_recovery_revealing_serial\b
